and make us all think
it's hopeless,

00:09:47.319 --> 00:09:49.422
and two, to set the stage
for a Supreme Court battle

00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:51.156
that will hand him a victory
even if he loses.

00:09:51.156 --> 00:09:53.659
He's repeatedly said as much,
including in Tuesday's debate.

00:09:53.659 --> 00:09:56.228
-Are you counting
on the Supreme Court

00:09:56.228 --> 00:09:59.131
including Justice Barrett,
to settle any disputes?

00:09:59.131 --> 00:10:00.700
-Yeah. I think
I'm counting on them

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.368
to look at the ballots,
definitely.

00:10:02.368 --> 00:10:06.605
We need nine justices.
You need that.

00:10:06.605 --> 00:10:11.910
With the unsolicited millions
of ballots that they're sending,

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.311
it's a scam, it's a hoax.

00:10:13.311 --> 00:10:14.847
Everybody knows that.

00:10:14.847 --> 00:10:17.649
And the Democrats know it
better than anybody else,

00:10:17.649 --> 00:10:20.018
so you're going to need nine
justices up there.

00:10:20.018 --> 00:10:21.587
I think it's going
to be very important.

00:10:21.587 --> 00:10:23.823
Paper ballots are very simple.

00:10:23.823 --> 00:10:25.957
Whether they counterfeit them,
forge them,

00:10:25.957 --> 00:10:27.126
do whatever you want.

00:10:27.126 --> 00:10:29.027
-Counterfeit them, forge them,
flush them.

00:10:29.027 --> 00:10:30.863
In fact, I've been going from
bathroom to bathroom

00:10:30.863 --> 00:10:33.366
recovering ballots that were
flushed by Democrats.

00:10:33.366 --> 00:10:34.599
Those were all votes for me.

00:10:34.599 --> 00:10:35.701
Just can't read them now.

00:10:35.701 --> 00:10:36.868
And Republicans
across the country

00:10:36.868 --> 00:10:38.304
with the help
of Trump's campaign

00:10:38.304 --> 00:10:40.506
are already setting the stage
for just such a legal battle

00:10:40.506 --> 00:10:43.575
by suing to delay counting
or invalidate ballots

00:10:43.575 --> 00:10:45.577
in swing states like Wisconsin,
Pennsylvania,

00:10:45.577 --> 00:10:46.879
Michigan and Texas.

00:10:46.879 --> 00:10:49.381
Trump's strategy is two-pronged,
to undermine the election

00:10:49.381 --> 00:10:51.350
and to create the impression
that he's inevitable.

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:53.652
We cannot get rid of him,
but we can.

00:10:53.652 --> 00:10:54.720
It's in our power to end this.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.856
We can repudiate Trump
and the GOP

00:10:56.856 --> 00:10:58.123
and give our democracy a...

00:10:58.123 --> 00:10:59.925
-Big fat shot in the ass.

00:10:59.925 --> 00:11:01.794
-This has been "A Closer Look."

